DESCRIPTION:Solomamma\n(4.3 →︎)\n\nComédie\, Drame\n𝟭𝗵𝟰𝟬\n
 \nNorway\, Finland\, Latvia\, Lithuania\, Denmark\n(Norwegian\, English)\n
 \n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿 : Janicke Askevold\n𝗦
 𝗰𝗲𝗻𝗮𝗿𝗶𝗼 : Janicke Askevold\, Jørgen Færøy Flasnes\
 , Mads Stegger\n𝗣𝗵𝗼𝘁𝗼𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗽𝗵𝗶𝗲 : Torjus 
